{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_title", "source_sha256": "a57f746afa099932276df2825f84fad10af5e0f97dbc5465b00ba67aa920af54", "ja": "キラキラのチカラ", "zh": "闪闪发光的力量", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c83aa86d91790f8742435e70db186cfb0a7ed5c02d4c447657d663ea33bf60dd", "ja": "仕事が順調なのにどこか元気のないエレナ。\n理由を尋ねると、弟と母がルーツの違いから\n喧嘩している事を話す。落ち込むエレナだっ\nたが、互いの気持ちを伝えるにはアイドルの\nエレナにしかできない方法があると気付く。", "zh": "工作明明很顺利，艾莲娜却总显得有些无精打采。\n询问理由后，她透露是因为弟弟和母亲因文化背景的\n差异而吵了架。虽然艾莲娜感到很沮丧，\n但她意识到还有唯有身为偶像的艾莲娜\n才能做到的方法，可以向彼此传达心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "2a338a724018e20863b02f10166d1f9561ea3e5b31f84fd709636e846b0d3766", "ja": "今歌ったのはワタシの新曲で、\n『シャクネツのパレード』でした♪", "zh": "刚才演唱的是我的新歌——《灼热的游行》♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "9877539e1d95f16d82ea35e7e9a1eab26fc0c2d1e5845e437e6cec636dd94eb0", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "e3db7ba88e5c55572122f62b0400d33555e820594467fa935742727cdd87b4d5", "ja": "それと、今日はすごいお知らせがあるんだヨ～！\n発表していいって言われたから、お知らせするネ！", "zh": "另外，今天还有个不得了的消息哦～！\n因为人家被允许公开，所以就来告诉你们啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a395b8744b050b0f12ea07ffae1e4e1d904cd557eda39ea92d40f0ca768c1da", "ja": "この間まで、ワタシがマンスリーゲストで出てた\nテレビ番組があるでしょ？　なんとなんと……。", "zh": "前段时间，我不是作为月度嘉宾参加过一档电视节目嘛？没想到没想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "78af9fad7f6900daf15de7c109bf5698899917db2bdc65465486bf9825927dad", "ja": "次のシーズンから、\nレギュラー入りが決定したんだヨー！！！", "zh": "从下个季度开始，我确定要成为常驻嘉宾啦！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "068099da2063430d0d328172385af786cad821f30585eca7a85821598cd88bd9", "ja": "おめでとー！！！", "zh": "恭喜ーー！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "b220a825cf8ed0706dddca726c9fc25cb70512b0092c6b15fbdf8d6df90d0479", "ja": "ありがとー！　エヘヘッ。……でもネ、最初は\nちょっとだけ、どうしよう？って思ったんだヨ。", "zh": "谢谢～！嘿嘿。……不过呢，一开始\n我其实稍微有点苦恼，不知道该怎么办呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "032a9492db6d133e67729502daeedc0efca52cd8221c69d7c03f3269e886478e", "ja": "なんでかっていうと……アイドルとしてじゃなく、\n『外国にルーツのある、面白い人』だったからー！", "zh": "之所以会那样，是因为……你不是作为偶像，而是作为“有着外国血统的、有趣的人”——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "ba016f1a68a1fca088817abbdf10cea883e006ab4992c9e2b1438f0572e71c77", "ja": "でもネ、考えたノ。\n違う国にいたパパンとママンが出会って恋をして……", "zh": "可是呀，我想过了哦。  \n身处不同国家的爸爸和妈妈相遇并坠入爱河……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf68a2e6ebeff83d227c5b1f8d9add3e556981eda73050817a0d266167b50c5a", "ja": "それって、ワタシの全部の……はじまりでしょ？\nだったら、大事にしたいなって……。", "zh": "那就是我的一切……的起点，对吧？\n既然如此，我想好好珍惜它……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "dd92750c6f7bf48b3d277e035d6fc4e271d5e8dab2d34569dd365d9ca8977661", "ja": "だから、島原エレナは『面白い人』じゃなくて、\n『アイドル』だって、テレビでも覚えてもらうから！", "zh": "所以，我要让大家即使在电视上也记住，岛原艾琳娜不是“有趣的人”，而是“偶像”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "84583cd6e859e8ad718557ffa445e5454ab71d12c7b0ace07ee01696052c48a8", "ja": "みんなも、応援よろしくネー！", "zh": "大家也要多多为我加油喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1012_null", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ed5020b645b56bda90ca37a663277f9169fee9a2328236bfb809ee5133b29055", "ja": "（会場には、エレナのご家族も来てくれた。\n楽しそうに見ていたな……）", "zh": "（艾莲娜的家人也来到了会场。\n看起来很开心啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "8b20c889c9219cadcc43e0f633636df39d6b830e1c971bbf43f1e0ef5d32db76", "ja": "{$P$}！　どうだった？\nステージ、みんな楽しんでくれたかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}！　怎么样？\n大家在舞台上看得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9028d5d471617d6251ed8709c5b82fb6673966453eb82b88f20a0adf2804515f", "ja": "ああ。お客さん達、みんなすごくいい笑顔だったよ。\nもちろん、エレナのご家族もな。", "zh": "是啊。客人们全都笑得特别开心。\n当然也包括艾丽娜的家人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0e6d2ad6be80c334a968ee0cdb50cd8d85398c77921efb6ba735266434564bc", "ja": "ホントに！？\n……よかった～！", "zh": "真的！？\n……太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "75fa91763807ae59b2d8170abd056a2c6dc6dedba973ec7cb3cffa3b9a803a6c", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\nアイドルって、本当にすごいんだネ！", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。\n偶像真的很厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "e6eba44de63d5a8e96a5c9f7d35887a05727b3fe290a4a2934ebbc1e7dbb2b2c", "ja": "だって、ケンカしてた人たちを、\nあっという間に笑顔にしちゃうんだもん！", "zh": "因为偶像能在转眼间让原本正在吵架的人们露出笑容嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ee31c84af460f51d3541ccc5111ed3d14ca58bb070a1c9034e0c300890436482", "ja": "そうだよ。アイドルはすごいんだ。", "zh": "没错，偶像就是很了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d372861d51b68f993a855392b7017e7ac99318e86476f924aa15407972ccd348", "ja": "だからエレナはすごいんだぞ！　今日、\nここに来てくれたみんなを、笑顔にしたんだからな。", "zh": "所以说，艾丽娜很厉害吧！今天，她让来到这里的大家都露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "94dce44e3c236cb2427f1b3289bdfacfc44ce459b069972659f6738e6708d3a7", "ja": "そうなノ？　エヘヘ……。\nだったら、うれしいナ……♪", "zh": "是这样的吗？嘿嘿……  \n那样的话，我会很开心的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_128_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7b16fadba8011c87c47e2db3ac032abdd2d1a9860706a890a05ec402deb5a958", "ja": "（この先に何があっても、きっと乗り超えていける。\nエレナには、人を、笑顔にする力があるから）", "zh": "（无论前方有什么，一定都能跨越过去。因为艾蕾娜拥有让人绽放笑容的力量。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
